<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.665 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.665 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.665 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.645 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 12		  Nov 11</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.665		   4.645</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    1.20		    0.27</p>
<p>				    Nov 12		  Nov 6</p>
<p> lei per 1,000 roubles	0.8500		  0.8425</p>
<p> volume traded (million rbls)   20			50</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
